http://www.jstatsoft.org/v11/i09/paper

Please include an extensive review of existing work, and specify what
exactly would be new in your proposal. You would also need to find
some mentors, and I can't do it since I'm too busy with other
projects. You may want to postpone this to next year since the
student application deadline is in 2 days.

